4013                 /       SYSGEN TIME HANDLER FIXUP ROUTINE.
4014   
4015                 /       MERELY MOVING THE HANDLER'S CODE TO WHERE IT BELONGS IN FIELD ZERO (AND ONE)
4016                 /       DOES NOT NECESSARILY MEAN IT WILL BE USABLE FOR GENASYS PURPOSES!
4017   
4018                 /       THIS ROUTINE SPACE IS PROVIDED TO ALLOW THE HANDLER TO MODIFY ITSELF FOR
4019                 /       GENASYS PURPOSES ONLY; THE PURE COPY WILL BE WRITTEN OUT INDEPENDENTLY.
